day so it kind of forms this kind of
vision you know my

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:28.280
world whatever but EMTs and every day
everytime you get the call it's just

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:33.230
it's just the question is just oh how
bad yeah you know that's what it is how

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:38.000
bad how bad of a situation is the person
I'm about to go content with what's

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:43.190
their situation yeah they are they could
be everything from a minor situation to

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:47.600
they're going to die in front of me
again again it's a new person will and

